bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/29d926accd978d1d4eecb9753e6be541.poster.avif?t=1773695745\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/29d926accd978d1d4eecb9753e6be541.webm?t=1773695745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/29d926accd978d1d4eecb9753e6be541.mp4?t=1773695745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU WILL DIE. A LOT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s okay \u2014 you\u2019re already un-dead. Instant respawns keep the pace fast as you retry and learn each delivery route. Every room has a solution... but it may not be the one you expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/76c91e2ec82943fdb14a71fb9af019a5.poster.avif?t=1773695745\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/76c91e2ec82943fdb14a71fb9af019a5.webm?t=1773695745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/76c91e2ec82943fdb14a71fb9af019a5.mp4?t=1773695745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS IS YOUR AFTERLIFE NOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dive deeper into the warehouse, you\u2019ll encounter even more elaborate delivery puzzles, new environmental hazards, and increasingly absurd demonic logistics systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN HELLBOUND INC YOU\u2019LL FIND:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Circles of Corporate Hell:</strong> Navigate 8 distinct departments, from the red tape of HR to the bottomless greed of Accounting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision &quot;Deliver or Die&quot; Gameplay:</strong> Tight 2D platforming where your package (and your soul) depends on pixel-perfect jumps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>47 Handcrafted Levels:</strong> A brutal progression of 6 orientation tutorials and 41 increasingly hellish puzzle rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Delivery Gauntlets:</strong> High-stakes sections at the end of every circle that push your skills to the absolute limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Corporate Audit:</strong> Hunt for hidden collectibles tucked away in the most dangerous corners of the fulfillment center.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hellish Workplace Soundtrack:</strong> An original score to keep your heart rate up while the clock ticks down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/1952c3a2cc3d59930ee76673cc235634.poster.avif?t=1773695745\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/1952c3a2cc3d59930ee76673cc235634.webm?t=1773695745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746940/extras/1952c3a2cc3d59930ee76673cc235634.mp4?t=1773695745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DELIVER OR BURN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rest for the dead. Clock in, grab your Package, and make the delivery \u2014 because Satan doesn\u2019t do refunds.</p>","developers":["Templo","Rewilder"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://sh